var WAIT_FOR_KISIB = "Every signature is in. The rotation that declares this change needs the chain key, rebuilt from enough members\u2019 paper shares: that is Ki\u0161ib\u2019s work, not Edubba\u2019s. Open Ki\u0161ib and choose \u201CRotate a collective\u201D: the member who proposed the change starts it there, and the other members give their shares in their own Ki\u0161ib. Until it counts, the change waits, signed and not in force.";
